{
  "name": "Salon Booking Bot | v2",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Salon Booking Bot (WhatsApp + Gemini)\n**Flow:** WhatsApp message -> normalize -> AI agent (Gemini + memory + 5 tools) -> reply on WhatsApp -> log to Google Sheets.\n\nThe agent never touches the sheet directly: every read/write goes through the **Salon Booking - Tools** sub-workflow, where the business rules live.\n\nThe customer phone is injected by the workflow (not chosen by the AI), so a customer can only see or cancel their own appointments.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "4d34502f-87b6-44ad-9e10-b8cfd50c46fd",
      "name": "Note: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -352,
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Agent tools\nEach tool calls the same sub-workflow with a fixed `action`. Fields using `$fromAI()` are filled in by Gemini; `phone` comes from the webhook.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "01546e91-ce14-4a5c-ab68-126998435ab9",
      "name": "Note: Tools",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        768,
        896
      ]
    },
